{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o001d","title":"曹丕病笃立曹叡为皇太子","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o001d-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"曹丕病笃立曹叡为皇太子","evidence":["mingdi-e-o001d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"立嗣","evidence":["mingdi-e-o001d-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"受立","evidence":["mingdi-e-o001d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":226,"label":"黄初七年夏五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y226","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o001","basis":"黄初七年夏五月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o001d-q","mingdi-q-o001","mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o001d-q","source_order":[3,2,"O001d"],"order":698}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o001d-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original","quote":"明皇帝讳叡，字元仲。文帝太子也。生而太祖爱之，常令在左右。﹝一﹞年十五，封武德侯。黄初二年为齐公。三年为平原王〖1〗。以其母诛，故未建为嗣。﹝二﹞七年夏五月〖2〗，帝病笃，乃立为皇太子。丁巳〖3〗，即皇帝位。大赦；尊皇太后曰太皇太后〖4〗，皇后曰皇太后〖5〗；诸臣封爵各有差。﹝三﹞〔六月〕，癸未〖6〗，追谥母甄夫人曰文昭皇后〖7〗。壬辰〖8〗，立皇弟蕤为阳平王〖9〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗七年：黄初七年（公元226）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7290e2008f81d6cad349","start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o001","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original",